{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"text\": \"欢喜稍落下来，他才承认自己不只想尽情喜欢，也盼对方同样渴望靠近、愿把彼此放在心上。\",\n      \"key\": \"放在心上\",\n      \"follows\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想被对方同样珍惜，也知道不能拿真心逼对方回应，怕自己的期待成了催促。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他一再想把盼望收回，却总觉得是在否认刚承认的心意，委屈之余也厌烦自己反复为难。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复为难\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得，关心对方、享受亲近本身就能让他快乐，不必先等对方给出保证。\",\n      \"key\": \"享受亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去渴望受抑、悬而未发的状态描写，保留他想被同样珍惜的愿望，以及不愿用真心逼对方回应、怕期待变成催促的顾虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-4\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去仍然享受亲近、未解不安暂时退居次位的体验描述，改用他此前关心对方、享受亲近本身就能获得快乐的经历，说明他此刻仍愿意珍惜这份亲近的原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20527936-6111-4a15-9972-7bb414f5f4b8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T022411621558Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.063, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T02:24:54.007056+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8edefbb93e7f4652375ce376b06f4e58d0bb32a2d3dc64